1. Implement dynamic pricing, adjusting our price based on real-time competitor's actions and market conditions;
      - Develop and update predictive models to forecast the impact of our price changes on both sales volume and profit;
      - Use machine learning to optimize these predictions;
      - Incorporate seasonality, customer segment preferences, and other market factors into pricing strategies.
   2. Enhance competitor's pricing monitoring system by integrating more efficient data collection methods and AI algorithms that learn from past observations;
